{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5001_p", "source_sha256": "9eb05fca5858b0779266b86a4034efd87eee9efc53b57fc51347aad9d9dba3eb", "ja": "（桃子の撮影のテーマは『社会科見学』。\n伝統工芸品の、手作り体験をすることになった）", "zh": "（桃子这次拍摄的主题是“社会科见学”。决定让她体验传统工艺品的手工制作。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5002_049mom", "source_sha256": "cd9abeedc45c1cb7a9c3e0680d6152aaf9b9e74cbec315a5d072ccecaeaf07de", "ja": "へえ……ていねいで、細かい作業だね。\n職人さんって、すごいね……桃子にできるかな？", "zh": "哇……真是细致又精巧的工作呢。\n工匠真厉害……桃子能做到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5003_p", "source_sha256": "6bdeaab649bb93fbe66d709b28040565a7ad70204fc642a1b8f7a99bcf8bd9be", "ja": "まあ、そんなに本格的なものじゃないみたいだから、\n大丈夫だと思うよ。やってみたいものは決まったか？", "zh": "哎呀，看起来也不是那么专业的东西，\n我想应该没问题的。决定好想做什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5004_049mom", "source_sha256": "c8da3dbeda2d0487bece990a06656909c6fda71f191fbbeaf8f2d7101c573d05", "ja": "うん。いろいろ気になるけど……2つで迷ってるの。\nかんざしと、きんちゃく袋。", "zh": "嗯。虽然有很多在意的……但在纠结2个。\n簪子，还有束口袋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5005_049mom", "source_sha256": "b70fff247ae8835da5fe437414b2ed9d8a8b876cb90ed0a714be6c0986e31c0d", "ja": "お兄ちゃんは、どっちがいいと思う？", "zh": "哥哥觉得哪个比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5006_p", "source_sha256": "6d29f1266cf1e562a363a9d212f15f7f2950b216aafbda8d30f331a27fa64d3a", "ja": "うーん？　そうだな……。", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5007", "source_sha256": "bfd01fd630268069e6db0145a54447c615a349fcbcb0b7f77c95e929b1586656", "ja": "かんざし", "zh": "发簪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5008", "source_sha256": "d6670b9310b13fd5c8b7210c858ac2c3e5b45512679c802ff9417feecccd701a", "ja": "きんちゃく袋", "zh": "束口袋", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5200_p", "source_sha256": "a485845fc6d7f208cdcb05d0d70ac59fbfb756f4a2fdd4ca7fbd67194b65c6f3", "ja": "かんざしはどうだ？\n小さな花がたくさんで、桃子に似合うと思うよ。", "zh": "发簪怎么样？\n上面有很多小花，我觉得很适合桃子喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5201_049mom", "source_sha256": "6b9d6b25a15199fd34596c6f120e22e5bc5e2c550611e49bc61c307e011bdff0", "ja": "べつに、桃子に似合うとかじゃないけど……。\n自由に作れて楽しそうだし、いいかもね。", "zh": "又不是因为适合桃子才……  \n不过可以自由制作，感觉挺有意思的，或许不错吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5202_049mom", "source_sha256": "2cc6add5c87e2c74874401913a21026d5db575f3cd20ffdf6b52731c53485331", "ja": "じゃあ、お兄ちゃん。作るの手伝って？\nかんざしを付けた姿も撮るなら、早く作らないとね！", "zh": "那么，哥哥。帮桃子一起做吧？\n如果还要拍戴着发簪的样子，就得快点做好才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5300_p", "source_sha256": "a485845fc6d7f208cdcb05d0d70ac59fbfb756f4a2fdd4ca7fbd67194b65c6f3", "ja": "かんざしはどうだ？\n小さな花がたくさんで、桃子に似合うと思うよ。", "zh": "发簪怎么样？\n上面有很多小花，我觉得很适合桃子喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5301_049mom", "source_sha256": "7adf604e08fe2649c0eab4f3926451397c773667abd973d3b8378b8acd1032d9", "ja": "お花って、なんだか子どもっぽくみえない？\nまあ、お兄ちゃんがどうしてもって言うならいいけど。", "zh": "花朵什么的，总觉得看起来有点孩子气吧？\n不过，要是哥哥坚持的话，也不是不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5302_049mom", "source_sha256": "45e7a6cbd3fae862b0f989bbe0e4216a7ecdf5ad278fb4a54f8f23bc20d352f5", "ja": "桃子、こういうのけっこう器用なんだから。\nお兄ちゃんの分も、作ってあげようか？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "桃子做这种东西还是挺灵巧的。  \n哥哥那份也要桃子帮你做吗？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5500_p", "source_sha256": "886fbfce8fa45a0162e2673a9282140f810a4fb63b27b9b10eb98d57bb73c6e7", "ja": "きんちゃく袋はどうだ？\n何を入れてもいいから、使い勝手がよさそうだ。", "zh": "束口袋怎么样？\n装什么都行，用起来应该挺方便的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5501_049mom", "source_sha256": "6ec61f5ce72474fa61a90082a5937f909b8339fe5c728384151c8fbe824aebd9", "ja": "たしかに、カバンに入る大きさなのもいいよね。\nきんちゃくってなんかカワイイし。そっちにしよっと。", "zh": "确实，大小刚好能放进包里也很不错呢。\n束口袋也挺可爱的。就选它吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5502_049mom", "source_sha256": "31c7a3792c7cea1800ab3360bacb37a9f687b5d8a4325380d06a0677722ac3fe", "ja": "桃子は何をいれようかな……。シールを入れたり、\nメイクポーチの代わりにしてもいいよね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "桃子要放些什么呢……装贴纸，或者代替化妆包也不错呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5600_p", "source_sha256": "886fbfce8fa45a0162e2673a9282140f810a4fb63b27b9b10eb98d57bb73c6e7", "ja": "きんちゃく袋はどうだ？\n何を入れてもいいから、使い勝手がよさそうだ。", "zh": "束口袋怎么样？\n装什么都行，用起来应该挺方便的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5601_049mom", "source_sha256": "616fb15bd6d8a529f51bfd68e922a3bf5ea31f8335c06ab6abc08287567cece5", "ja": "まあ、使いやすさは大切だと思うけど……。\nわかった。じゃあ、きんちゃく袋にするね。", "zh": "嗯，我也觉得实用性挺重要的……\n好吧。那就做抽绳袋吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_5602_049mom", "source_sha256": "155486749358ba5e21abafcbe30032a184bcd7e4e63167880886f50d502e94df", "ja": "えっと……針と糸を使って縫うんだよね……。\nへ、平気！　お裁縫は授業で習ったし……見ててね！", "zh": "那个……要用针线缝起来，对吧……\n没、没问题！我在课上学过缝纫……看好了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
